%% Title: Debate Session Lifecycle
%% Description: What happens during a live multi-agent debate session

flowchart TD
    A[Room Active Page] --> B[Worker Joins Room]
    B --> C[Greeting Spoken via TTS]
    C --> D[Orchestrator: route_turn<br/>Pick Next Speaker]
    D --> E[generate_turn<br/>Agent Utterance via Groq]
    E --> F[Publish speaker_change<br/>+ turn_committed]
    F --> G[TTS Speaks Turn<br/>via Cartesia]
    G --> H{Human Silent<br/>5+ Turns?}
    H -- No --> I{Max Turns<br/>Reached?}
    I -- No --> D
    I -- Yes --> M[Session Ends]
    H -- Yes --> J[Generate Quiz Question]
    J --> K[Publish quiz_event]
    K --> L{Human Responds<br/>in 30s?}
    L -- Yes --> N[Record Human Turn<br/>Reset Silent Count]
    N --> D
    L -- No --> O[Agent Self-Answers]
    O --> D
    M --> P[Synthesize Debrief<br/>via Groq]
    P --> Q[Calculate XP]
    Q --> R[POST /session/end]
    R --> S[Navigate to Debrief]
